  <!-- ======== STORY ======== -->
  <div id="story" class="screen scanlines grain vignette">
    <div class="story-inner">
      <div class="story-header">&mdash; the story so far &mdash;</div>
      <p class="story-text p1">You never should have taken the shortcut.</p>
      <p class="story-text p2">The road through Blackwood Forest closed decades ago — after what happened at the cabin. The locals still won't speak its name. But your car broke down two miles back, and the gas station clerk just stared when you asked for directions.</p>
      <p class="story-text p3">Now the trees press in on every side. Your flashlight flickers. Somewhere behind you, a branch snaps. Then another. Closer.</p>
